%N A016068 Inverse of 2059th cyclotomic polynomial.
%C A016068 Periodic with period length 2059. - _Ray Chandler_, Apr 07 2017
%H A016068 Ray Chandler, <a href="/A016068/b016068.txt">Table of n, a(n) for n = 0..3000</a>
%H A016068 <a href="/index/Per#periodic">Index entries for periodic sequences</a>.
%H A016068 <a href="/index/Rec#order_1960">Index entries for linear recurrences with constant coefficients</a>, order 1960.
%H A016068 <a href="/index/Pol#poly_cyclo_inv">Index to sequences related to inverse of cyclotomic polynomials</a>
%p A016068 with(numtheory,cyclotomic); c := n->series(1/cyclotomic(n,x),x,80);
%t A016068 Module[{x, nmax = 100}, PadRight[CoefficientList[Series[1/Cyclotomic[2059, x], {x, 0, nmax}], x], nmax + 1]] (* _Paolo Xausa_, Sep 24 2026 *)
%o A016068 (PARI) Vec(1/polcyclo(2059)+O(x^99)) \\ _Charles R Greathouse IV_, May 30 2026
%K A016068 sign,easy,changed
%O A016068 0,1
%A A016068 _Simon Plouffe_
